{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yiFYJ1atvv1794409197.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報，美國人工智能(AI)公司Anthropic首次公開招股已獲得的認購意向，相當於發售股數的數倍。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》引述消息報道，Anthropic認購需求主要來自，所謂錨定規模認購意向。</p><p></p><p>根據Anthropic申報的文件顯示，計劃通過首次公開招股和配售籌集最多904億美元，集資額有望超過SpaceX的基礎發行集資規模750億美元，成為全球歷來規模最大的上市集資，並將於本月19日掛牌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:21:17.798846+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:30.707639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:30.707639+00:00","content_hash":"a56060cbc33ac3d076e0384232123d96c09e10ba13f26105ed4db14b9d2bf0e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}